00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.020
Yeah. A lot of people.

00:04:30.796 --> 00:04:33.120
It wasn't a locals.
It was people out of town.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.280
-Oh, okay.

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:36.240
It was people out of town
