00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:39.145
The local had made no money.
The local had to sit back and look.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:44.690
[Peter] That's interesting.
So this was a lumber town.

00:04:45.156 --> 00:04:47.189
It's peaceful, I gotta say. It's sorta…

00:04:47.189 --> 00:04:49.589
-You wanna rip off and be away from it all.
-Yeah.

00:04:49.589 --> 00:04:53.086
It's just the camera's not gonna capture,
you guys, unfortunately.

00:04:53.086 --> 00:04:57.399
But the buffer zone
around here is absolutely massive.

00:04:57.859 --> 00:05:02.620
So this is in a way preserved
because it's surrounded by these parks.

00:05:02.627 --> 00:05:03.627
Yes. Yeah.

00:05:03.927 --> 00:05:06.240
There's no development
that's gonna happen out here.

00:05:06.247 --> 00:05:08.716
I would've liked to ask Billy
