00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.940
-Stop it, bro.
-Stop it. You stop it. You stop it.

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:26.365
Man, that's what's up.

00:05:26.365 --> 00:05:27.680
I do, bro.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.145
-You cool with me rolling the camera?
-That's what's up, bro.

00:05:30.145 --> 00:05:32.477
-I see you all the time, man.
-What are you doing out here?

00:05:32.477 --> 00:05:34.320
-I live right here, bro.
-In the tent?

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.240
-Yes, sir.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.420
-What's your name?
-I'm Brian.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:37.500
-Brian.
-Yes, sir.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.820
-How'd you end up out here?
-My whole life, bro. My family.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.050
-Seriously?
-Seriously.

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:43.945
I got another guy you'd probably be
